5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to understand why past schedules failed. I will examine the two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I am worried about how our locations and hours affect who can actually reach us. I will check the bus links in the two outer wards.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The funding structure often looks fine initially but crumbles later. I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of repeating history. I will check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see what actually happened.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about whether our staff can handle new tasks. I will check the volunteer register and supervision training.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, if bus links are poor, our reach is limited regardless of the service. I will also check winter road closures north of the river.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, exactly! Access is everything. I will also look at evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to see how people actually connect with us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, access matters, but money must last. I will also check the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, money is vital, but I need to know if people actually showed up. I will check the two programmes begun six years ago.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I agree. I will also check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification to see what skills we actually have.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, skills are useful, but if the roads close, no one arrives. I will check the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, skills help, but if people cannot get here, it is pointless. I will check the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Daisuke, skills are important, but without stable funding, we cannot sustain them. I will check the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, skills are nice, but I need proof people actually showed up. I will check the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, I understand the access risk. But if we lack the right skills, the service fails even if people arrive.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the running and equipment lines last year. We need to know if our baseline is stable before adding more.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
